      "pinyin": "lí kāi K T V de shí hou zuì hòu chàng le yì shǒu gē jiào běi jīng běi jīng",
      "english": "Last night I went to karaoke with a friend and drank a lot of alcohol."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Before leaving KTV, we sang one final song called “Beijing, Beijing”."
